WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.090
Choose a photo of the paper. On a phone, you can take one right away.

2
00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:10.760
The edges of the paper are found for you. Drag a corner if it's not quite right.

3
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.230
The page is straightened and cleaned up, like a real scan.

4
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:18.540
Tick Make the text searchable, so you can search and copy the text later.

5
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.940
Then click Make PDF.

6
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.280
Click Save. Your scan is saved on your device.

7
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.730
The photo never left your device.
